ome","entry_revision_identity":"50202b04d598b7619fe284a0b6f61815cc650142cc57a45bf10f0388e105e041","logical_entry_identity":"f70eb3613d1904cd3ce3c18a50b8fbd2b9f221246f59470c493c249626e8ac46","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Equip a bandolier holding up to %d throwing knives, allowing you to attack from range.  You automatically reload %d knives per turn while resting, or half as many while moving.\n\t\tThe base power, Armour penetration, and critical strike chance of your knives increase with talent level, accuracy increase with your accuracy, and damage is improved with Dagger Mastery.\n\t\tThrowing Knives count as melee attacks for the purpose of on-hit effects.\n\t\tEffective Throwing Knife Stats:\n\n%s","source_tag":"tformat","target":"装备一条最多可容纳 %d 把飞刀的刀带，使你能够进行远程攻击。休息时每回合自动装填 %d 把飞刀，移动时装填数量减半。\n\t\t飞刀的基础强度、护甲穿透和暴击几率随技能等级提高，命中随你的命中值提高，伤害受匕首掌握加成。\n\t\t投掷飞刀可触发近战命中效果。\n\t\t投掷飞刀属性：\n\n%s"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"98c92f974a7a7fd596712c6f8138d4b8b0734f59bfa6979ee9393277d42b8a6c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5024931492e885579e0aff1b3faf7c5757ac88d66e1e9c6512f327268c3e65ae","logical_entry_identity":"fd2d6414d7a3f6cf27dcfd46500606479141454b83c3f5793c2fe02a23818415","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Randomly generate actors subject to a filter and/or create random bosses according to a data table.\nFilters are interpreted by game.zone:checkFilter.\n#ORANGE#Boss Data:#LAST# is interpreted by game.state:createRandomBoss, game.state:applyRandomClass, and Actor.levelupClass.\nGeneration is performed within the _G environment (used by the Lua Console) using the current zone's #LIGHT_GREEN#npc_list#LAST#.\nPress #GOLD#'F1'#LAST# for help.\nMouse over controls for an actor preview (which may be further adjusted when placed on to the level).\n(Press #GOLD#'L'#LAST# to lua inspect or #GOLD#'C'#LAST# to open the character sheet.)\n\nThe #LIGHT_BLUE#Base Filter#LAST# is used to filter the actor randomly generated.","source_tag":"_t","target":"根据给定的筛选器随机生成角色，或/并根据给定的数据表生成随机Boss。\n筛选器由game.zone:checkFilter处理。\n#ORANGE#Boss数据：#LAST#由 game.state:createRandomBoss, game.state:applyRandomClass, 和 Actor.levelupClass处理。\n生成过程在 _G 环境下进行（也是 Lua 控制台使用的环境），并使用当前地图的#LIGHT_GREEN#npc_list#LAST#。\n请按#GOLD#'F1'#LAST#获得帮助。\n鼠标移动查看角色预览（放置到楼层时可能会被进一步调整）。\n（请按 #GOLD#'L'#LAST# 在Lua中检查，或按 #GOLD#'C'#LAST# 打开角色面板）\n\n#LIGHT_BLUE#基础过滤器#LAST#用于过滤生成的随机角色。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d152a49978b0578e752ca8395f7fdec4f72a49f5860e25947d47706c007512c0","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5024b5fd241a16af60baaa25bc3335d739f5e19ab83b7008c1aef0aafbd6034d","logical_entry_identity":"b5bb92ff468cbaf716eb14b83c80eef43fbdc6d385dd5c5fb53894291ca94951","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Orb of Destruction (Orb of Command)","source_tag":"entity name","target":"指令水晶球（毁灭）"}],"fixed_source_identity":"commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63","rendered_briefing":"WP2-Lite surface screen; review only","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","terminology_snapshot":"9c5578a9655e6dd80db73e1cd996c97dce1bee4abd5e219636a19c81f80a7672"}}